{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29057","headline":"赠李伊阙 · 许浑","name":"赠李伊阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐履如飞不可寻，一壶双笈峄阳琴。\n舟横野度寒风急，门掩荒山夜雪深。\n贫笑白驹无去意，病慙黄鹄有归心。\n云间二室劳君画，水墨苍苍半壁阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}